### 403 TEST
### ============================================================

### TEST 17 - Valid JWT, wrong role (READER hitting an ADMIN-only endpoint) -> expect 403
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{readerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test",
  "description": "Test"
}


